{"strongs": "H4918", "word": "מְשֻׁלָּם", "translit": "me.shul.lam", "root": "משלם", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Meshullam", "definition": "מְשֻׁלָּם proper name, masculine Μεσουλαμ , Μοσολλαμ , etc.: 1. grandfather of Shaphan 2Kgs 22:3 . 2. son of Zerubbabel 1Chr 3:19 . 3. in Benjamin: \\ \\ a. 1Chr 8:17 , perhaps = \\ \\ b. 1Chr 9:7 . \\ \\ c. v 1Chr 9:8 . \\ \\ d. Neh 11:7 . 4. in Gad 1Chr 5:13 . 5. wall-builders: \\ \\ a. Neh 3:4 ; Neh 3:30 . \\ \\ b. Neh 3:6 . 6. a chief Neh 10:21 . 7. priests (distinctions in part obscure): \\ \\ a. 1Chr 9:11 ; Neh 11:11 ; Neh 12:13 (perhaps = שַׁלּוּם 11 ). \\ \\ b. 1Chr 9:12 . \\ \\ c. Neh 10:8 . \\ \\ d. Neh 12:6 . \\ \\ e. v Neh 12:33 . 8. Levites: \\ \\ a. 2Chr 34:12 . \\ \\ b. Ezra 8:16 ; Ezra 10:15 ; Neh 8:14 . \\ \\ c. Neh 12:25 ( = שַׁלּוּם 12 a ). 9. Ezra 10:29 . above", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8747')\">BDB8747</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4918')\">H4918</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H7967')\">H7967</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8746')\">BDB8746</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8748')\">BDB8748</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מְשֻׁלָּם</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <grk>Μεσουλαμ</grk>, <grk>Μοσολλαμ</grk>, etc.:</p><div class=\"section\"><p></div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> grandfather of Shaphan <ref ref=\"2Kgs 22:3\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(12,22,3)\">2Kgs 22:3</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> son of Zerubbabel <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,19)\">1Chr 3:19</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> in Benjamin: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,17)\">1Chr 8:17</ref>, perhaps = <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,7)\">1Chr 9:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> v<ref ref=\"1Chr 9:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,8)\">1Chr 9:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 11:7\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,7)\">Neh 11:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> in Gad <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:13\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,13)\">1Chr 5:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> wall-builders: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,4)\">Neh 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 3:30\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,30)\">Neh 3:30</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:6\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,6)\">Neh 3:6</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> a chief <ref ref=\"Neh 10:21\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,21)\">Neh 10:21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> priests (distinctions in part obscure): <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,11)\">1Chr 9:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 11:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,11)\">Neh 11:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:13\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,13)\">Neh 12:13</ref> (perhaps = <bdbheb>שַׁלּוּם</bdbheb> <b>11</b>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,12)\">1Chr 9:12</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 10:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,8)\">Neh 10:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 12:6\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,6)\">Neh 12:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> v<ref ref=\"Neh 12:33\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,33)\">Neh 12:33</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>8.</b> Levites: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,12)\">2Chr 34:12</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:16\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,16)\">Ezra 8:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:15\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,15)\">Ezra 10:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 8:14\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,14)\">Neh 8:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 12:25\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,25)\">Neh 12:25</ref> ( = <bdbheb>שַׁלּוּם</bdbheb> <b>12 a</b>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>9.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:29\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,29)\">Ezra 10:29</ref>. above </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Kgs 22:3", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 22, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "1Chr 3:19", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "1Chr 8:17", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "1Chr 9:7", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "1Chr 9:8", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Neh 11:7", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "1Chr 5:13", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 5, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Neh 3:4", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Neh 3:30", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Neh 3:6", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Neh 10:21", "book": "NEH", "chap